{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f0540338-45bd-8d88-af19-e8d50c516ba3",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T09:16:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:14:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I want to report a pothole. Hmm, let me see, I'm in a store right now, so bear with me. Canned tomatoes, diced, no salt added... sorry. Okay, the pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in front of 273 Ayrault Street. Well, not in front exactly, a little up from the house. It showed up after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "273 Ayrault Street. Can you tell me how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, it's deep. Deep enough to swallow a tire, honestly. Black beans, low sodium, okay not those. And it's right in the bike lane, so that's, yeah, that's a problem for anybody riding through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a deep pothole in the bike lane at 273 Ayrault Street, after the storm. I'll put that in for the road crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Um, how long does it usually take for them to fix something like that? A few days, a couple weeks, or, no, let me think, longer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on how many reports are ahead of it. After a storm the crews are busy, so it could be days to a couple of weeks. Deep ones in a travel lane tend to get looked at first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fair. Do you need a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:16:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. Jorge Varela."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166, Jorge Varela. Thanks for calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
